WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.330
As a young prince, the future
Buddha lived in palace luxury.

2
00:00:04.380 --> 00:00:07.980
Then came six years of
harsh ascetic practice.

3
00:00:08.030 --> 00:00:10.450
Neither extreme brought awakening.

4
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:14.120
In his first sermon, he named
a Middle Way between them.

5
00:00:14.170 --> 00:00:18.030
And he said that Middle Way
is the Noble Eightfold Path:

6
00:00:18.080 --> 00:00:21.980
eight factors, from right
view to right concentration.

7
00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:25.920
Eight sounds like a ladder,
climbed one rung at a time.

8
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:28.250
But is that how Buddhists walk it?

9
00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:32.400
In this mission, you'll sort the
eight factors into three trainings:

10
00:00:32.450 --> 00:00:35.120
wisdom, ethics and meditation.

11
00:00:35.170 --> 00:00:38.280
Then you'll see what the
path asks in daily life:

12
00:00:38.330 --> 00:00:41.960
right speech, right action
and right livelihood.

13
00:00:42.010 --> 00:00:46.450
Your mission: find out how Buddhists
walk a path of eight parts.
